  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Sets nearby insects on the target for {{math spellPower \"/\" 2}} rounds, dealing 1d4 damage per round.</p><p>Each round the target takes a Resolve test against Panic. The swarm puts a 5% penalty on success rolls and a 50% penalty on Ranged attacks and Perception tests, costs the target one Reaction, and prevents Aiming.</p><p>The effect can be neutralised with Repellent ointment, or with a spell such as Fiery aura.</p>",
